config EDAC_CORTEX_REF
	tristate "ARM Cortex-A72 Reference EDAC driver"
	depends on EDAC && ARM64
	help
	  Generic reference EDAC driver for ARM Cortex-A72 L2 cache and
	  associated memory controller error detection and correction.

	  This driver demonstrates the standard EDAC poll-based reporting
	  interface. It is designed to run under QEMU virt (ARM64) and
	  on real Cortex-A72 based hardware where the memory controller
	  exposes error status registers in a compatible format.

	  The driver registers one memory controller instance (mc0) with
	  configurable numbers of csrows and channels. Error injection is
	  supported via the kernel fault injection framework when
	  CONFIG_FAULT_INJECTION=y.

	  If unsure, say M.
